    {
      "id": "fujiang:java-web:cve-2021-26084-confluence-ognl-preauth",
      "category": "java-web",
      "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/java-web/cve-2021-26084-confluence-ognl-preauth.md",
      "mirror_ref": "skills/kb-java-web/cve-2021-26084-confluence-ognl-preauth.md",
      "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-java-web/cve-2021-26084-confluence-ognl-preauth.md",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Confluence 未授权 OGNL 注入（pre-auth，ENCODED_TOKEN）",
        "cve": "CVE-2021-26084",
        "severity": "critical",
        "source_cvss": "9.8",
        "product": "Atlassian Confluence Server / Data Center",
        "versions": "6.1.0 - 6.13.23、7.4.0 - 7.4.10、7.11.0 - 7.11.5、7.12.0 - 7.12.4",
        "ports": "8090, 8443",
        "keywords": "confluence, ognl, pre-auth, queryString, doenterpagevariables",
        "entry": "/pages/doenterpagevariables.action 的 queryString",
        "verified": "false",
        "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
      },
      "metadata_origin": "source-frontmatter",
      "fingerprint": "- `X-Confluence-Request-Time`；`/pages/createpage.action`；版本见 `/login.action` 页脚。\n- 未授权可访问 `/pages/doenterpagevariables.action`。",
      "preconditions": "- 未授权即可（无需登录），只要该 action 可达。",
      "remediation_source": "- 升级到 6.13.23 / 7.4.11 / 7.11.6 / 7.12.5 / 7.13.0+。\n- 临时：反代只放行已知路径（`/pages/` 的 `doenterpagevariables` 直接 deny）；WAF 拦 `\\u0027%2b%7b`。",
      "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2021-26084；Atlassian 公告 2021-08-25。",
      "references": []
    },
