      "metadata": {
        "title": "Confluence 未授权 OGNL 注入（Confluence OGNL RCE）",
        "cve": "CVE-2022-26134",
        "severity": "critical",
        "source_cvss": "9.8",
        "product": "Atlassian Confluence Server / Data Center",
        "versions": "1.3.0 - 7.4.17、7.13.0 - 7.13.7、7.14.0 - 7.14.3、7.15.0 - 7.15.2、7.16.0 - 7.16.4、7.17.0 - 7.17.4、7.18.0 - 7.18.1",
        "ports": "8090, 8443",
        "keywords": "confluence, ognl, cve-2022-26134, atlassian, rce",
        "entry": "",
        "verified": "false",
        "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
      },
      "metadata_origin": "source-frontmatter",
      "fingerprint": "- 响应头 `X-Confluence-Request-Time`、`X-AUSERNAME`；页面含 `Confluence`。\n- `GET /login.action` 200；`/rest/api/space` 未授权可能也 200。",
      "preconditions": "- 未授权即可（本漏洞最大的价值）。",
      "remediation_source": "- 升级到 7.4.17 / 7.13.7 / 7.14.3 / 7.15.2 / 7.16.4 / 7.17.4 / 7.18.1 及以上。\n- 无法升级：WAF 拦 URI 中的 `${`、`%24%7B`；前置反代只放行已知路径。",
      "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2022-26134；Atlassian 安全公告 2022-06-02。",
      "references": []
    },
